        "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/k/b5ac83/{size}.png",
        "created_at": "2013-05-30T04:54:30.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Got another crazy hard combo, this one was not a randomized one though... It was pick.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Akash'bhuta (Normal) vs. Expatriette, Absolute Zero and The Argent Adept at The Block.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>God... it was so horrible. I'd say the worst mistake we made was letting Scar stay out for 2 rounds. So... many... villain cards played...</p>",
