        "cooked": "<p>Scar? Do you mean Char?</p>\n<p>I can imagine Akash'Bhuta will get a lot of free plays in the Block, especially since not only is it a pretty target-heavy environment, there's plenty of stuff that <span class=\"bbcode-i\">destroys</span> environment targets as well, so once she flips you're not much better off. I don't think we've fought her there yet but I can imagine it's…interesting ;).</p>",
